        "start": 87.374,
        "end": 91.24,
        "text": "一个人落寞的坐在桌子上偷偷抹眼泪的时刻，那个时候你才会爱上他",
        "representativeTime": 89.307,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-034.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-035",
        "start": 91.25,
        "end": 92.897,
        "text": "因为这一瞬间你催生了心疼",
        "representativeTime": 92.073,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-035.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-036",
        "start": 92.897,
        "end": 96.74,
        "text": "那么说完广告变现博主，我们来说企业主这个企业主是包括那些",
        "representativeTime": 94.819,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-036.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012",
          "SHOT-013",
          "SHOT-014"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-037",
        "start": 96.75,
        "end": 98.486,
        "text": "以卖产品为变现逻辑的博主的",
        "representativeTime": 97.618,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-037.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-014"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-038",
        "start": 98.486,
        "end": 100.889,
        "text": "为什么现在所有的企业主都要下场做ip",
        "representativeTime": 99.688,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-038.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-014",
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-039",
        "start": 100.889,
        "end": 105.43,
        "text": "因为创始人ip就是从认识到信任，这是一个很好的降低用户决策成本的方法",
        "representativeTime": 103.16,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-039.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-040",
        "start": 105.44,
        "end": 107.892,
        "text": "你可以催生一批为了你这个人来买你产品的用户",
        "representativeTime": 106.666,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-040.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-041",
        "start": 107.892,
        "end": 110.694,
        "text": "那么这个时候我们的创始人ip是和我们企业紧密联系",
        "representativeTime": 109.293,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-041.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-042",
        "start": 110.694,
        "end": 112.912,
        "text": "因为你的创始人ip可以反映你的企业文化",
        "representativeTime": 111.803,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-042.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-043",
        "start": 112.912,
        "end": 115.25,
        "text": "比如说雷军小米的slogan是为发烧而生",
        "representativeTime": 114.081,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-043.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-044",
        "start": 115.26,
        "end": 118.34,
        "text": "所以雷军造车这个事情就巩固了他一往无前的ip",
        "representativeTime": 116.8,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-044.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-045",
        "start": 118.34,
        "end": 120.3,
        "text": "宇浩每天在抖音上发几百条视频",
        "representativeTime": 119.32,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-045.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-046",
        "start": 120.3,
        "end": 123.8,
        "text": "说自己要当世界首富，这种表演型的人设也增强当企业的",
        "representativeTime": 122.05,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-046.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-047",
        "start": 123.81,
        "end": 124.962,
        "text": "狠性文化，狼性文化",
        "representativeTime": 124.386,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-047.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-048",
        "start": 124.962,
        "end": 127.394,
        "text": "那么老板去做ip的时候，通常有两种需求",
        "representativeTime": 126.178,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-048.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-015",
          "SHOT-016"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-049",
        "start": 127.394,
        "end": 132.26,
        "text": "第一种可能是增进品牌影响力，第二点就是只求转化，通常是由他们企业规模所决定的",
        "representativeTime": 129.827,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-049.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-016",
          "SHOT-017"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-050",
        "start": 132.27,
        "end": 135.002,
        "text": "之前有个在广东做电商母婴的老板找我咨询",
        "representativeTime": 133.636,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-050.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-017"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-051",
        "start": 135.002,
        "end": 139.03,
        "text": "他的企业量就差不多是在五千万左右，他跟我说我不要求我能火",
        "representativeTime": 137.016,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-051.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-017"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-052",
        "start": 139.04,
        "end": 141.87,
        "text": "我也不想有名，我只是希望我的销量能有所增加",
        "representativeTime": 140.455,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-052.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-017"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-053",
        "start": 141.87,
        "end": 146.05,
        "text": "之前有个在香港做地产的姐来找我咨询，她的企业已经是十几亿的规模",
        "representativeTime": 143.96,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-053.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-017"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-054",
        "start": 146.06,
        "end": 147.927,
        "text": "但是我不要求你给我带来变现的转化",
        "representativeTime": 146.993,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-054.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-017"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-055",
        "start": 147.927,
        "end": 152.13,
        "text": "我只想把我个人推出来，去增强我品牌的影响力，对于企业主呢做ip有两个方向",
        "representativeTime": 150.029,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-055.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-017"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-056",
        "start": 152.14,
        "end": 154.552,
        "text": "第一个就是口播利观点，利权威利信任",
        "representativeTime": 153.346,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-056.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-017"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-057",
        "start": 154.552,
        "end": 155.687,
        "text": "第二种就是拍日常",
        "representativeTime": 155.12,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-057.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-017"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-058",
        "start": 155.687,
        "end": 157.247,
        "text": "使你这个人更立体更亲和",
        "representativeTime": 156.467,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-058.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-017"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-059",
        "start": 157.247,
        "end": 161.93,
        "text": "增强你的粘性，关于ip呢就说到这里，我是人类最想编的，我们下期再见",
        "representativeTime": 159.589,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-059.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-017",
          "SHOT-018",
          "SHOT-019",
          "SHOT-020"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
